v-denno/#394\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Jackson v. Denno\">378 U. S., at 394-396</a></span>;\n  <em>\n   Sims\n  </em>\n  v.\n  <em>\n   Georgia,\n  </em>\n  <span class=\"citation\" data-id=\"107340\"><a href=\"/opinion/107340/sims-v-georgia/#544\" aria-description=\"Citation for case: Sims v. Georgia\">385 U. S., at 544</a></span>.\n </p>\n<judges id=\"b163-12\">\n  Mr. Justice Black dissents.\n </judges>\n</opinion>"}],"citations":[]}